From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 02:20:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] AI_AB_TEST War: flags SiegeArmy, ArmyHandoff (off in the
 bundle)

From the 3 logged King games: no war brought a quarter of the damage a
capture needs, and a delivered army walked home the turn after war began.

- SiegeArmy (CvAIOperation): a land city attack (also the sneak attack)
  stays in the recruiting stage until its units' expected damage on the
  target city reaches the city's healing plus a fifth of its max HP, for up
  to 20 turns, and meanwhile asks for units for its optional slots too.
  Logs "SiegeArmy: waiting for more units ...".
- ArmyHandoff (CvTacticalAI::PlotReinforcementMoves): units deployed by an
  operation in the last 5 turns may reinforce an enemy city's zone even from
  a zone that "needs" them, instead of falling through to the homeland AI's
  sentry moves. Logs each case ("ArmyHandoff: ...").

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01G2NZizcmgfGkXsgJcVcF7h
